{"kind":"symbol","sections":[],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["iOS","iPadOS","Mac Catalyst"],"tokens":[{"text":"- (","kind":"text"},{"text":"BOOL","preciseIdentifier":"c:@T@BOOL","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"setFeatureStateForFeatureID:","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"NSString","preciseIdentifier":"c:objc(cs)NSString","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" *) ","kind":"text"},{"text":"featureID","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"state:","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"NSDictionary<NSString *,id>","preciseIdentifier":"c:Q$objc(cs)NSDictionary","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" *) ","kind":"text"},{"text":"state","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":";","kind":"text"}],"languages":["occ"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"parameters":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The identifier of the feature whose state to set.","type":"text"}]}],"name":"featureID"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A set of key-value pairs to merge into the feature’s state. The","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"values should be valid JSON types.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"state"}],"kind":"parameters"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"return-value","text":"Return Value","type":"heading","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"YES"},{"type":"text","text":" if the source is attached to a map and the update was"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"dispatched."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"kind":"mentions","mentions":["doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre-Native-for-iOS\/FeatureStateExample"]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"discussion","level":2,"text":"Discussion","type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A feature’s state is a set of user-defined key-value pairs that are assigned"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"to a feature at runtime. The state object is merged with any existing"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"key-value pairs in the feature’s state. Feature state can be read in style"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"expressions through the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"feature-state"},{"type":"text","text":" expression operator."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The target feature must have an identifier in the underlying source data:"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"either an "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"id"},{"type":"text","text":" attribute in the original GeoJSON data, or an "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNFeature","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"whose "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"identifier"},{"type":"text","text":" is set."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"This method can only be used while the source is attached to a map.","type":"text"}]}]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre","doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShapeSource"]]},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Sets the state of a feature in this source."}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnshapesource\/setfeaturestateforfeatureid:state:"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}]}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"occ","url":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShapeSource\/setFeatureStateForFeatureID:state:"},"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"metadata":{"title":"setFeatureStateForFeatureID:state:","fragments":[{"text":"- ","kind":"text"},{"text":"setFeatureStateForFeatureID:state:","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"- ","kind":"text"},{"text":"setFeatureStateForFeatureID:state:","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","modules":[{"name":"MapLibre"}],"externalID":"c:obj